      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><msqrt><mfrac><mrow><mn>3</mn><mi>E</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>m</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>c</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></msqrt></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mi>c</mi></math>",
      "is_correct": true
